1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,100
What if your AI remembered why it got something wrong?

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,225
Same shopping list.

3
00:00:05,225 --> 00:00:06,350
Fewer repeated decisions.

4
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:08,220
Meet Precedent.

5
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,959
Your shopping rules, remembered.

6
00:00:09,959 --> 00:00:15,176
It separates what is handled, what needs you, and what is blocked.

7
00:00:15,176 --> 00:00:17,350
Every decision carries its rule.

8
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:19,233
Cheaper coffee.

9
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:20,117
Too acidic.

10
00:00:20,117 --> 00:00:22,767
The correction becomes a new rule.

11
00:00:22,767 --> 00:00:28,068
Pay the premium, keep the original record, and remember why next time.

12
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,524
Two rules disagree?

13
00:00:30,524 --> 00:00:32,089
It pauses and asks.

14
00:00:32,089 --> 00:00:34,046
One answer resolves the conflict.

15
00:00:34,046 --> 00:00:38,350
The new rule governs; the old one stays on the record.

16
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:40,816
Walrus stores the history.

17
00:00:40,816 --> 00:00:43,382
Tatum checks the mainnet account and delegate.

18
00:00:43,382 --> 00:00:47,048
This is a captured result from the real proof page.

19
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:51,950
The weekly shop should not require a weekly debate.

20
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:53,950
It should require a record.

21
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:54,350
Precedent.
